UC-DLV-06
Title:
Order in queue (when no courier available)
Description:
A ready order that no courier can take waits in a single first in, first out dispatch queue, visible to the operator. The system retries assignment whenever a courier becomes idle, so no order is dropped.
Primary Actor:
System
