An order becomes Ready or returns to the queue, and no eligible courier is idle
The system adds the order to the dispatch queue
The operator sees the order in the queue
A courier becomes idle by going on duty, completing a delivery or declining an offer
The system takes the oldest queued order and applies the dispatch rule (UC-DLV-01)





